          "thread": "Sovereign Bitcoin accumulation scale",
          "why": "Bhutan surpassing El Salvador as a sovereign BTC holder — funded by hydropower mining rather than tax purchases — reframed the country as a credible crypto-state actor, not a gimmick."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "BTC sell-off and reserve drawdown",
          "why": "Readers tracked each on-chain transfer to exchanges or QCP Capital-linked wallets with alarm, especially as holdings slid two-thirds from peak and the 10,000 BTC Gelephu pledge appeared at risk."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Gelephu Mindfulness City crypto hub",
          "why": "The SAR's moves — anchoring BTC/ETH as strategic reserves, fast-tracking crypto licenses, and offering zero-tax incentives — positioned it as Bhutan's regulatory sandbox and drew attention as a novel jurisdiction-building model."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "TER gold-backed token on Solana",
          "why": "A sovereign-linked gold-backed RWA token issued on Solana and custodied by a national bank offered readers a concrete example of Bhutan extending its crypto ambitions beyond Bitcoin into tokenized real assets."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "National crypto payment infrastructure",
          "why": "The Binance Pay and DK Bank partnership for tourism payments made Bhutan the first country to deploy a national crypto payment rail, connecting sovereign holdings to everyday economic use."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Ethereum-anchored digital identity",
          "why": "Anchoring a national digital identity system on Ethereum signaled that Bhutan's blockchain strategy extends into public-sector infrastructure, not just treasury management."
        }
      ]
